minutes notwithstanding the fact that we're all phenomenologists you look as if you've just seen

00:14:12.350 --> 00:14:19.840
a ghost perhaps i have been i was meditating i saw your son johnny jesse and your young assistant

00:14:19.840 --> 00:14:22.040
haji in terrible danger

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:35.440
Dr. Quest, such crude security systems you have.

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:39.140
You too secure the bond.

00:14:39.380 --> 00:14:40.720
You're with me, Lorenzo.

00:14:41.160 --> 00:14:41.820
Let's do it.

00:14:59.300 --> 00:14:59.860
On your goggles.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:14.030
lorenzo and watch your step johnny come in johnny do you read me come in no signal whatsoever the

