Primary Quest Compound Security Systems have been breached.

00:15:49.430 --> 00:15:54.320
Primary Quest Compound Security Systems have been breached.

00:15:55.040 --> 00:15:59.970
I repeat. Primary Quest Compound Security Systems have been breached.

