Then we gotta split up.

00:16:06.970 --> 00:16:08.370
I'll go check out the compound.

00:16:08.950 --> 00:16:10.550
Jesse Bannon, logging out of...

00:16:10.550 --> 00:16:11.750
Quest World, terminate!

00:16:12.440 --> 00:16:12.920
Terminate!

00:16:17.430 --> 00:16:17.810
We're trapped!

00:16:19.030 --> 00:16:19.490
Real.

00:16:21.180 --> 00:16:25.740
overridden your verbal commands, Johnny Quest and Jesse Bannon.

00:16:27.190 --> 00:16:28.710
You knew it was us all along?

00:16:29.430 --> 00:16:29.970
I know

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:34.460
So your fathers are in the Himalayas, because I sent them there three weeks early.

00:16:35.120 --> 00:16:41.200
And now that Julia and Lorenzo have control of the Quest Compound, this little game is

00:16:41.200 --> 00:16:41.860
over.

