Ajir.

00:16:50.770 --> 00:16:51.350
Ajir.

00:16:52.660 --> 00:16:54.700
Your friends are in danger, Ajir.

00:16:55.860 --> 00:16:56.380
Wake up!

00:16:56.740 --> 00:16:57.340
Jesse?

00:16:58.700 --> 00:16:59.040
Johnny?

00:17:18.170 --> 00:17:18.510
reach.

00:17:30.340 --> 00:17:30.800
I did.

