00:18:38.290 --> 00:18:44.760
Right behind you, Chiquita, with your little friend's gun cocked, safety off, and ready to rock.

00:18:44.900 --> 00:18:45.260
Gracias.

00:18:46.720 --> 00:18:49.220
See, I'm not too hot on guns.

00:18:49.450 --> 00:18:50.750
You little punk.

00:18:51.870 --> 00:18:54.270
I, on the other hand, don't have a problem with them.

00:18:54.430 --> 00:18:57.930
It's all a matter of how you use them, isn't it?

00:19:00.090 --> 00:19:03.110
You're making a big mistake. You're way over your heads.

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:30.440
Enzo!

00:19:32.010 --> 00:19:32.490
Johnny

00:19:33.190 --> 00:19:33.750
