00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:01.640
visions of U3 in danger.

00:20:02.170 --> 00:20:03.130
Are you sure you're okay?

00:20:03.510 --> 00:20:05.510
Everything at the Quest compound's all right.

00:20:05.910 --> 00:20:09.830
Uh, yeah, everything's fine. No problems here, Dad.

00:20:10.330 --> 00:20:12.570
