00:20:20.440 --> 00:20:23.220
It's not a lie, Hodge. It's a protective fib.

00:20:23.860 --> 00:20:24.420
Besides

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:28.100
Someone has to shelter my dad from the harsh realities of life.
